                    1970-73, AID (US) 1. No classification marking.
                    Attached to a September 22 memorandum from Rogers to the President informing him that Hannah had requested that he forward the
                    letter.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d65-f2" n="2" xml:id="d65-f2-content">
                <p>The foreign assistance reorganization legislation submitted to Congress on April
                    21 (see <ref target="#d60">Document 60</ref>) was not enacted.</p>
